# Smoke test, the same for every firmware: boots, survives every control
# end to end (knobs, buttons, Settings, CV), keeps refreshing its LEDs and
# keeps its output finite. A crash or hang fails the run.
wait 3500
expect booted
expect alive
expect leds > 4
sing 220
wait 500
pot 1 0
pot 2 0
pot 3 0
pot 4 0
pot 5 0
pot 6 0
wait 300
pot 1 0.25
pot 2 0.25
pot 3 0.25
pot 4 0.25
pot 5 0.25
pot 6 0.25
wait 300
pot 1 0.5
pot 2 0.5
pot 3 0.5
pot 4 0.5
pot 5 0.5
pot 6 0.5
wait 300
pot 1 0.75
pot 2 0.75
pot 3 0.75
pot 4 0.75
pot 5 0.75
pot 6 0.75
wait 300
pot 1 1
pot 2 1
pot 3 1
pot 4 1
pot 5 1
pot 6 1
wait 500
expect finite
tap b1
wait 300
tap b2
wait 300
tap b1
wait 300
tap b2
wait 300
hold b1 1000
hold b2 1000
press b3                 # the alternate page while held
wait 300
pot 1 0.3
pot 6 0.7
wait 300
release b3
wait 300
expect alive
# Settings: B2 + B3 held 2 s, B1 through the pages, out with B3
press b3
wait 50
press b2
wait 2300
release b2
release b3
wait 400
tap b1
wait 300
tap b1
wait 300
tap b1
wait 300
pot 2 0.4
wait 300
tap b3
wait 600
expect alive
# CV: every input jack low -> high -> low, then a ramp on J4
cv 3 5
cv 4 5
cv 5 5
cv 6 5
cv 7 5
cv 8 5
wait 400
cv 3 0
cv 4 0
cv 5 0
cv 6 0
cv 7 0
cv 8 0
wait 400
cv 4 -5
wait 200
cv 4 2.5
wait 200
cv 4 0
wait 300
silence
wait 500
expect finite
expect alive
pot 1 0.5
pot 2 0.5
pot 3 0.5
pot 4 0.5
pot 5 0.5
pot 6 0.5
sing 220
wait 1000
mark
wait 500
print rms
print cv
print screen
snapshot build/clouds/smoke.bmp
